---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Trophy from "@tabler/icons/outline/trophy.svg";
import ExternalLink from "@tabler/icons/outline/external-link.svg";
---

<Layout title="About - Gomi" transition:animate="fade">
  <section class="mb-10 flex items-center gap-5">
    <img
      src="/Gomi_Avatar.png"
      alt="Gomi"
      width="80"
      height="80"
      class="ring-border/60 size-20 shrink-0 rounded-full object-cover ring-2"
    />
    <h1 class="text-chrome text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight">About Me</h1>
  </section>

  <div class="glass rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8">
    <p class="text-foreground/90 text-base leading-relaxed sm:text-lg">
      Hi，我是勾鑫宇（Gomi），2019年本科毕业于成都东软学院-信息管理与信息系统专业。先后就职于<a
        href="https://www.sefonsoft.com"
        target="_blank"
        class="text-foreground decoration-muted-foreground/50 hover:decoration-foreground font-medium underline underline-offset-4 transition-colors"
        >Sefonsoft</a
      >和<a
        href="https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/702976469"
        target="_blank"
        class="text-foreground decoration-muted-foreground/50 hover:decoration-foreground font-medium underline underline-offset-4 transition-colors"
        >四川邦辰信息科技有限公司</a
      >，目前就职于<a
        href="https://www.yixintanggroup.com/"
        target="_blank"
        class="text-foreground decoration-muted-foreground/50 hover:decoration-foreground font-medium underline underline-offset-4 transition-colors"
        >一心堂数字化产研中心</a
      >，任职前端开发工程师。
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="glass mt-6 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8">
    <h2 class="mb-5 flex items-center gap-2 text-xl font-semibold">
      <Trophy class="text-chrome-4 size-5" />
      获奖经历
      <a
        href="https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E6%88%90%E9%83%BD%E4%B8%9C%E8%BD%AF%E5%AD%A6%E9%99%A2%20%E6%AF%94%E8%B5%9B%E8%8E%B7%E5%A5%96%20%E5%8B%BE%E9%91%AB%E5%AE%87"
        target="_blank"
        class="text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground ml-1 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-normal transition-colors"
        title="AI总结"
      >
        <ExternalLink class="size-3.5" />
        百度AI总结
      </a>
    </h2>
    <ul class="text-foreground/80 marker:text-chrome-4 ml-1 list-disc space-y-2.5 pl-5 text-base">
      <li><a href="https://segmentfault.com/a/1190000043289217?utm_source=sf-backlinks" target="_blank" class="text-foreground decoration-muted-foreground/50 hover:decoration-foreground font-medium underline underline-offset-4 transition-colors">SegmentFault 思否2022年度Top Writer（技术问答）</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/SHh2UcZeBTLykexGqCuNDA" target="_blank" class="text-foreground decoration-muted-foreground/50 hover:decoration-foreground font-medium underline underline-offset-4 transition-colors">2019年四川省优秀毕业生</a></li>
      <li>2019年四川省大学生综合素质A级证书</li>
      <li><a href="https://bm.nsu.edu.cn/2019/535A4F88-7678-4A77-8665-1789D90ACAD3.html" target="_blank" class="text-foreground decoration-muted-foreground/50 hover:decoration-foreground font-medium underline underline-offset-4 transition-colors">第十二届中国大学生计算机设计大赛四川省二等奖、全国总决赛三等奖</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://itbm.nsu.edu.cn/2018/585F550B-2235-405C-87C4-50E9147B0E33.html" target="_blank" class="text-foreground decoration-muted-foreground/50 hover:decoration-foreground font-medium underline underline-offset-4 transition-colors">第八届全国大学生"创新、创意及创业"挑战赛全国总决赛二等奖</a></li>
      <li>第四届全国移动互联创新大赛全国总决赛二等奖</li>
      <li>第四届全国大学生网络编辑创新大赛程序组一等奖</li>
      <li>2018年四川省创青春大赛铜奖</li>
      <li><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/oBiBdvvML-nf3hOXpghjCA" target="_blank" class="text-foreground decoration-muted-foreground/50 hover:decoration-foreground font-medium underline underline-offset-4 transition-colors">第二届创业蛙大赛总决赛一等奖</a></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</Layout>
